---
import { ThemeToggle } from '@/components/theme-toggle'
import MainLayout from '@/layouts/main.astro'
---

<MainLayout
  description="Self-host Nore OG with Docker and Cloudflare Workers."
  title="Self-host · Nore OG">
  <header class="border-b">
    <nav
      aria-label="Main navigation"
      class="mx-auto flex h-14 w-full max-w-4xl items-center justify-between px-4">
      <a class="flex items-center gap-2.5" href="/">
        <img
          alt="Nore OG"
          class="size-7 rounded-md"
          height="28"
          src="/logo/logo.svg"
          width="28"
        />
        <span class="hidden text-sm font-medium sm:inline">Nore OG</span>
      </a>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-xs">
        <a
          class="rounded-md px-2.5 py-1.5 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground"
          href="/">
          Home
        </a>
        <a
          class="rounded-md px-2.5 py-1.5 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground"
          href="/how">
          How to use
        </a>
        <a
          aria-current="page"
          class="rounded-md px-2.5 py-1.5 font-medium"
          href="/self-host">
          Self-host
        </a>
        <a
          class="rounded-md px-2.5 py-1.5 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground"
          href="/zh/self-host">
          中文
        </a>
        <ThemeToggle locale="en-US" />
      </div>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="mx-auto w-full max-w-4xl px-4 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs text-muted-foreground">SELF-HOST</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">
        Run Nore OG on your own infrastructure
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-5 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground">
        Nore OG consists of a standalone Node.js rendering API and an Astro frontend.
        Run the API with Docker and deploy the frontend to Cloudflare Workers by
        default.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-10">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-medium">1. Deploy the rendering API</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground">
          Build and run the Docker image from the repository root:
        </p>
        <pre
          class="mt-4 overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border bg-muted/30 p-4 font-mono text-xs leading-6"><code>docker build -t nore-og-api .
docker run --rm -p 3003:3003 nore-og-api</code></pre>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-medium">2. Configure the web frontend</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground">
          Set the public API address in the web package build environment. Do not add
          a trailing slash:
        </p>
        <pre
          class="mt-4 overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border bg-muted/30 p-4 font-mono text-xs leading-6"><code>PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=https://og-api.example.com</code></pre>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-medium">3. Deploy the Astro frontend</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground">
          Install dependencies, then run the existing deployment script from the
          repository root:
        </p>
        <pre
          class="mt-4 overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border bg-muted/30 p-4 font-mono text-xs leading-6"><code>pnpm install
pnpm deploy</code></pre>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</MainLayout>
